#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An exploration of variational quantum algorithm design covers applications "
"to chemistry, max-cut, and more."
msgstr ""
"Eine Einführung in das Design variationaler Quantenalgorithmen, mit "
"Anwendungen in der Chemie, beim Max-Cut-Problem und mehr."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

